    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p data-start=\"2120\" data-end=\"2133\"><em data-start=\"2120\" data-end=\"2133\">(6th Level)</em></p><p data-start=\"2135\" data-end=\"2166\">You specialize in interruption.</p><ul data-start=\"2168\" data-end=\"2315\"><li data-start=\"2168\" data-end=\"2246\"><p data-start=\"2170\" data-end=\"2246\">reroll the lowest die on Counterspell, Dispel Magic, and equivalent negation tests.</p></li><li data-start=\"2247\" data-end=\"2315\"><p data-start=\"2249\" data-end=\"2315\">When you successfully negate an effect, you may leave <strong data-start=\"2303\" data-end=\"2314\">Residue</strong>.</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"2317\" data-end=\"2342\">Residue creates friction:</p><ul data-start=\"2344\" data-end=\"2427\"><li data-start=\"2344\" data-end=\"2396\"><p data-start=\"2346\" data-end=\"2396\">Recasting the same effect in this scene is harder.</p></li><li data-start=\"2397\" data-end=\"2427\"><p data-start=\"2399\" data-end=\"2427\">The conceptual scar lingers.</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"2429\" data-end=\"2457\">Residue does not add damage.</p><p data-start=\"2459\" data-end=\"2475\">It adds silence.</p>",
